{kulānandatantram}

oṃ namo bhairavāya

	kailāsaśikharāsīnaṃ devadevaṃ jagadagurum |
	paripṛcchatyumādevī ekānte jñānamuttamam || 1 ||
	bhedanīmuttamabhedaṃ yathā dehavyavasthitam |
	kathayasva purābhedaṃ kulānandeṣu cottamam || 2 ||
	sthānāntaraviśeṣeṇa vijñānaṃ kathayasva me |
	sadyaḥ pratyayakārakaṃ yathā dehe vyavasthitam || 3 ||
	pāśastobhañca vedha(na)ñca dhūnanaṃ kampanaṃ 
tathā |
	khecaraṃ samarasañcaiva balīpalitanāśanam ||
	sarvaṃ tattu sureśvara kathayasva mama prabho || 4 ||


bhairava uvāca 


	śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi purabhedaṃ samuttamam |
	etat kaulikaṃ jñānaṃ kulānande cāṣṭottamaḥ || 5 ||
	brahmasthāne yat kamalaṃ catuḥṣaṣṭidalānvitam |
	tatraiva manasā rodhya lakṣayeddīpaśikhān vratī || 6 ||
	paśyati sarvadehe tu divyadṛṣṭirvarānane |
	tena lakṣitamātreṇa jāyate siddhiruttamā || 7 ||
	tasyopari nābhimnadavadā (?) vicakṣaṇe |
	tathā coparitiṣṭhati devo bhairavo jagatprabhuḥ || 8 ||

<p. 108>

	tasyāgre manasāropya dṛḍhabhūtavicakṣaṇāḥ |
	jāyate dhvanibhirjātiṃ tatra marudviśeṣataḥ || 9 ||
	etad vijñānamātreṇa āveśaṃ kurute dhruvam |
	jāyate paramaṃ sthānaṃ nātra kāryavicāraṇāt || 10 ||
	athānyaṃ paramaṃ devi sadyaḥ pratyayakārakam |
	taṃ pravakṣyāmi he devi śṛṇuṣvāyatalocane || 11 ||
	aṅgulyadvitīyaṃ devi yat pūrvaṃ kathitaṃ mayā |
	tatraiva sthāpayedvittaṃ kathitaṃ jāyate dhruvam || 12 ||
	atītānāgatañcaiva vartamānaṃ tathaiva ca |
	tatraivotpādayet sṛṣṭiṃ tīvrajyotiḥsamākṛtiḥ || 13 ||
	hṛdisaṃsthakamalaṃ hitvā mūrdhni yān prapūrayet |
	pāśastobhaṃ karotyevaṃ yadi viśramate manaḥ || 14 ||
	athānyaṃ paramaṃ devi divyadṛṣṭi pravartate |
	jvalajvālanamadhyasthaṃ dvijagranthi nirīkṣayet || 15 ||
	tatraiva manasā rodhya cūlikāgrantu mānayet punaḥ |
	sṛṣṭiṃ pravartante devi nātra kāryavicāraṇāt || 16 ||

devyuvāca

	tadvedhañca śuddhasārañca hitaṃ mayā na prakāśitam 
|
	kathayasva viśeṣeṇa yathā jānāmi tatkṣaṇāt || 17 ||


bhairava uvāca 


	śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi vedhasāraṃ yathākramam |
	brahmasthāne(.....)padmaṃ catuḥṣaṣṭidalānvitam || 18 ||

<p. 109>

	tatraivotpādayet sṛṣṭiḥ daṇḍākārāgnitejasā |
	bhedayitvā mahāgranthiṃ dvicakrañca tathaiva ca || 19 ||
	mūrdhni kamalasaṃsthānaṃ jvalanākāraṃ vicintayet |
	calantaṃ bhrāmayettena niyataṃ tu mahītale || 20 ||
	bedhaye girivṛkṣāṇi kiṃ punaḥ kṣudrajantavaḥ |
	athānyaṃ paramaṃ devi vijñānaṃ bhadrakaṃ śṛṇu || 
21 ||
	bhruvoścakṣurmadhyasthaṃ ca kālāvunā (?) (....)vicintayet 
|
	yāvadviśramate nityaṃ bhramate cakravat śiraḥ || 22 ||
	durāśravaṇavijñānaṃ bhūtadetasya (?) cintayet |
	vāmasrotaṃ tu yāvat tīvratejasamaprabham || 23 ||

devyuvāca 

	balīpalitakṣayaṃ deva tvayā khyātaṃ mamāgrataḥ |
	etanme saṃśayo deva kathayasva mama prabho || 24 ||


bhairava uvāca

	śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi yat surāṇāmapi durlabham |
	dvātriṃśatidalaṃ padmaṃ tiṣṭhati tanmūrdhni 
madhyataḥ || 25 ||
	tatraiva bhāvayedamṛtaṃ kalāṣoḍaśasamanvitam |
	hṛccakraṃ pātayeddvāraṃ (?) yāvadānābhimaṇḍalam 
|| 26 ||
	cintayet kṛṣṇavarṇañca bhedaṃ tu sakalaṃ puraḥ |
	palitāstambhayeddevi māsamekena suvrate || 27 ||
	athānyaṃ paramaṃ devi guhyasaṃśayasthitikārakam |
	yatra catuṣpathasthānaṃ tatra sarvāsurālayam || 28 ||

<p. 110>

	tatraiva sthāpayeccittaṃ divyabālapravartata(?) |
	aśrutāṃ vadate bālāṃ(...........)ḍivya varānane || 29 ||
	viṣaprahāraṃ kurute jvaravyādhiṃ vināśayet |
	tataḥ parataraṃ sthānaṃ tatra sarve pravartate || 30 ||
	athānyaṃ paramaṃ devi durāvedhaṃ vadāmyaham |
	jvalajjvalanasaṃdhyasthaṃ tatraiva lakṣayeddevi || 31 ||
	taṃ tritakoṭisamaprabhā ūrddhvaṃ śakti nipātānyataḥ 
(?) |
	vedhayedvicakṣaṇaḥ vedhayitvā tu taṃ lakṣayet || 32 ||
	jvalanākāṣṭhaprabhāṃ ūrddhvaśaktiṃ cakrayitvā 
acalaṃ bhrāmayet punaḥ (?) |
	vedhayet sā manaḥsahasrāṇi samakāni tu kā kathā || 33 
||
	evaṃ jñātvā vīrārohe vicaret yathāsukham ||
	devāsuramanujānāṃ durlabho bhavati sādhakaḥ || 34 ||

devyuvāca

	dhūnanaṃ kampanaṃ deva yathākhyātaṃ mamāgrataḥ 
|
	tataścāpi saṃśayo deva kathayasva mama prabho || 35 ||

bhairava uvāca 

	śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi dhūnanaṃ kampanaṃ sthitam |
	yā sā mahāvahā nāḍī kucelyākārasaṃsthitā || 36 ||
	tatraivotpādayet dṛṣṭirdaṇḍākārasutejasā |
	hṛccakra(...............) tīvraśakti suvigrahā || 37 ||
	dhūnanaṃ kampanaṃ caiva nātra kāryavicāraṇāt |
	athānyaṃ paramaṃ devi khecaratvaṃ śṛṇu priye || 38 ||

<p. 111>

	yā sā mahāvahā nā(ḍī) kuṇḍalyākārasaṃsthitā |
	padadvandvagatā sā tu mūrdhnisthaṃ kamalaṃ punaḥ || 
39 ||
	yā vīrataye tajjvalanākāraṃ subhāvayedbudhaḥ |
	sarvaśaktito madhyata khecaratva bhavedveḥ 
navāhamabhṛtaṃ dadaitaḥ (?) || 40 ||
	athānyaṃ sampravakṣyāmi mahāvyāptiṃ varānane |
	yāvad(......)ṣthāneṣu khyātā tasya mayāgrataḥ || 41 ||
	tathaiva manasāropyaṃ nāsāgre pavanamānena |
	manasaṃ tattva vedhayitvā niṣkalaṃ yojayedbudhaḥ || 42 
||
	mahāvyāptirbhaveddevi tavāhamanṛtaṃ vadet |
	athānyaṃ sampravakṣyāmi yena siddhirbhavet dhruvam || 
43 ||
	vargātītasya dvitīyamanuloma na suvrate |
	jvalanārūḍhaṃ kṛtvā caturthaṃ svarasaṃyutaḥ || 44 ||
	bindumastakasambhinnamādau yojayedbudhaḥ |
	vargātītaṃ punardevi ṣaṣṭhasvaravibhūṣitaḥ || 45 ||
	sa śikhe kharabindusaṃyuktaṃ yojayeddevi tat punaḥ |
	yakārasya pañcamaṃ gṛhya taṃ tṛtīyasvarasamanvitam || 
46 ||
	svaraṃ dvitīyasaṃyuktaṃ kārayet punaḥ priyaḥ |
	vargasya prathamaṃ bījaṃ sṛṣṭerādyato yojayet || 47 ||
	etaddevi samākhyātaṃ kulavidyāsamanvitam |
	nityaṃ tu yojayeddevi ekacittastu paṇḍitaḥ || 48 ||

<p. 112>

	tasya sarvā bhavet siddhiḥ sarvajñāneṣu sundari |
	na khedayāmi kasya cittaṃ śiṣye'pyuktvā varānane || 49 
||
	athānyaṃ paramaṃ devi kāmena vihvalakārakam |
	bhagasya madhyastha bhagamadho hutāśanam || 50 ||
	preritaḥ pavanaḥ śaktyā jvalanākāratejasā |
	visantu cintayeddevi sṛṣṭikamalantu yāvat || 51 ||
	śravaṇaṃ cintayedamṛtaṃ tejomārgeṇa yogini |
	bhavanti vihvalā nāryaḥ kṣaṇamekena suvrate || 52 ||
	athānyaṃ paramaṃ devi phalapuṣpākathanaṃ ca |
	śṛṇuyāt paramādevi aghoravikramā || 53 ||
	ākarṣayedbudho vāyuṃ piṇḍasthaṃ rūpaṇamucyate |
	cakṣuṣā yojayeddevi phalapuṣpantu cintayet ||
	tejasākarṣayet tu(.....)cittaṃ susaryataḥ || 54 ||

devyuvāca

	sarvatra tu mayā jñānaṃ bhāṣitaṃ deva tat purā |
	adyāpi saṃśayo devi kathayasva mama prabho |
	saṃgamānmokṣahetukaṃ (.................................) || 55 ||

bhairava uvāca

	śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi yat surairapi durlabham |
	āsanaṃ tu sthitaṃ kṛtvā(........)viśva anivṛttaḥ || 56 ||
	abhāvaṃ bhāvayeddevi sarvabhāvavivarjitam |
	cittaṃ tatra sthitaṃ kṛtvā khamadhye viniyojayet || 57 ||

<p. 113>

	bhāvayet samarasaṃ devi prabhubhṛtyaṃ vicakṣaṇaḥ |
	etadvijñānamātreṇa gīyate tatra madhyataḥ || 58 ||
	dūrāśravaṇavijñānaṃ vedhastobhaṃ madhyataḥ |
	āveśaṃ darśanaṃ dūrāt kampastobhaṃ tathaiva ca || 
59 ||
	parakāyapraveśena sampravarteta yoginaḥ |
	(...   ...   ..)ṭadabhyāsena suvrate || 60 ||


[iti matsyendrapādāvatāritaṃ kulānandaṃ samāptamiti] ||

[śubhamastu sarvajagatāma] |




